/-!
# A348168

Segment the list of prime numbers into sublists L_1, L_2, ... with L_1 = {2} and L_n = {p_1, p_2, ..., p_a(n)}, where a(n) is the largest m such that for 0 < i < m, p_1 - prevprime(p_1) > p_2 - p_1 >= p_{i+1} - p_i.

The 87 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A348168

